                                "sense_id": "6f2c21ec-88d9-377e-998d-911309c7dc34",
                                "text": "\"No, there was never a school,\" said the child; \"but the patwaris bibi lets us come to her of a morning, and teaches us bhajans and our letters, and when we learn well she sometimes gives us fruit.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20b68fe1-2737-4be4-ab0d-bddb876c2c61",
                                "sense_id": "6f2c21ec-88d9-377e-998d-911309c7dc34",
                                "text": "Did I detenct Father's deep and rumbling baritone in the chorus which accompanied my wife's first bhajan of the evening?"
